segments.text:
Heereby alſo it is cleare, in what other Prieſtes differ
from Chriſt. 1 Theſe te•ch onlie by their outward voice,
and not by the inwarde woorking alſo of the holie Ghost 2. They doe not make continual interceſsion, neither do they alwaies obtaine what they aske 3. Theſe applie their benefits vnto no man. 4. They offer not them-ſelues a Sacrifice for the ſinnes of others. For all theſe thinges, can bee and are perfourmed by CHRIST alone.
